    <string name="charger_test_how">Compare chargers and cables: plug one in, start the test and keep the phone still for about a minute. For fair comparisons, test at a similar battery level (ideally below 80%) with the screen on.</string>
    <string name="charger_test_high_level">The battery is above 80%, where charging slows down on purpose. Results will be lower than the charger can do.</string>
